{"3756910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Catgirl Rage: Claws of Fury", "steam_appid": 3756910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>“Defeat the demons with the power of cat magic!”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/7e71878eb3c538e54923e45409850c6c.avif?t=1788235255\" width=1217 height=811 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Story</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In this magical world, a chosen few cats are born with magical powers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">These cats resemble humans and grow up to become heroes who protect humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">One day, as a crimson moon rises, the boundaries between parallel universes collapse, and demons begin crossing dimensions to launch their attack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dark Ego, a being who turns humanity’s primal desires into demons and plots the end of the world, seeks to corrupt the peaceful world shared by humans and cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But behind Dark Ego lurks yet another entity controlling the demons…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This game is an action fantasy title set in the same universe as its predecessor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The story takes place after the defeat of Dark Ego, the final boss of the previous game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/b2132dd438cdd493d79e99a4817f56af.avif?t=1788235255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras_big/b2132dd438cdd493d79e99a4817f56af.webp?t=1788235255 width=1560 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The cats who once lived in the magical world have now crossed over into modern civilization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Travel across dimensions and explore cities around the world that have been consumed by darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Journey through distinctive locations around the globe, including downtown Tokyo, Times Square in New York, the Alps, Mexico, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/33bdde5b2c2b9f3e846ded52d85ecba2.avif?t=1788235255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras_big/33bdde5b2c2b9f3e846ded52d85ecba2.webp?t=1788235255 width=1560 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/68670452face42415e5992a4c406f9c7.poster.avif?t=1788235255\" width=846 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/68670452face42415e5992a4c406f9c7.webm?t=1788235255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/68670452face42415e5992a4c406f9c7.mp4?t=1788235255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/e703af4fa42482e40c10685bcdc86aef.avif?t=1788235255\" width=1554 height=677 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each character has her own unique combat style and magical skills, bringing a fresh experience to every battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Akane: A fiery cat who fights with her fists, combining powerful strikes with lightning-fast combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Koro: A cool-headed cat who freezes enemies with ice magic and crushes them with her sharp, spear-like staff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Leah: A laid-back cat who unleashes wide-ranging attacks and follows them up with paint projectiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Yuri: A righteous cat who swings a hefty staff and strikes her enemies with electricity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/d61e722f6100c38d218434129bfb2111.avif?t=1788235255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras_big/d61e722f6100c38d218434129bfb2111.webp?t=1788235255 width=1560 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> <u>The moment a magic staff becomes a blunt weapon.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Don’t underestimate a magic staff!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Haven’t you ever wanted to just beat an enemy down with one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience the perfect combination of hard-hitting melee combos and spectacular magical effects, delivering satisfying action for both your eyes and your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Counter System : Feel the thrill of deflecting enemy attacks with perfect timing!<br>Exploit the opening, stun your enemies, and unleash a barrage of attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Aerial Combos : Launch enemies into the air and keep the hits coming! <br>Create your own combo chains and leave your enemies completely overwhelmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Coin System : Collect coins dropped by defeated enemies and grow stronger with every run! <br>Just how powerful can a cat become?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/afb6e2b0fd860ca833dafc638728d3da.avif?t=1788235255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras_big/afb6e2b0fd860ca833dafc638728d3da.webp?t=1788235255 width=1560 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/f642c32fa935a68d22621fe9777eb3fd.poster.avif?t=1788235255\" width=846 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/f642c32fa935a68d22621fe9777eb3fd.webm?t=1788235255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/f642c32fa935a68d22621fe9777eb3fd.mp4?t=1788235255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Normal Battles : Sweep through hordes of enemies with the satisfying impact of classic beat ’em up combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Boss Battles : Counters, parries, and combos! Face powerful bosses in intense one-on-one battles and experience the tension of Soulslike-inspired combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/2414ba4676b382997188f7691cd41430.avif?t=1788235255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras_big/2414ba4676b382997188f7691cd41430.webp?t=1788235255 width=1560 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/d784052f472357df3e9de554dad869c5.poster.avif?t=1788235255\" width=846 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/d784052f472357df3e9de554dad869c5.webm?t=1788235255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/d784052f472357df3e9de554dad869c5.mp4?t=1788235255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Playing alone is fun, but protecting the dimensions with a friend is even better!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use the synergy between characters to create devastating combo plays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Have Koro freeze enemies solid, let Akane smash them apart, then follow up with Leah’s paint attacks for a spectacular co-op battle experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/979191f82d4b919caf2c0fb64713afd0.avif?t=1788235255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras_big/979191f82d4b919caf2c0fb64713afd0.webp?t=1788235255 width=1560 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grow stronger as your enemies become increasingly powerful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use coins earned through combos to unlock character stats and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Add new attacks to your arsenal and create your own unique combo chains!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/9db9e0ca170d8baecde2507b561bb44d.avif?t=1788235255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras_big/9db9e0ca170d8baecde2507b561bb44d.webp?t=1788235255 width=1560 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/4781299a0092d4473acccb8c14550500.poster.avif?t=1788235255\" width=846 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/4781299a0092d4473acccb8c14550500.webm?t=1788235255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/4781299a0092d4473acccb8c14550500.mp4?t=1788235255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Upgraded graphics and hard-hitting combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The adorable cat girls are brought to life with even more vibrant and detailed pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience dazzling magical effects and visual sequences unlike anything else, all rendered in a distinctive pixel-art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/bff36234f80e7c64fab30287c6c966c4.avif?t=1788235255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras_big/bff36234f80e7c64fab30287c6c966c4.webp?t=1788235255 width=1560 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Story Mode</strong> : Embark on a journey to find the final boss controlling the demons from behind the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Co-op Mode</strong> : A two-player cooperative mode to enjoy with a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Boss Rush</strong> : A challenging mode featuring intense battles against a series of bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Tutorial</strong> : Learn the counter and combo systems and practice developing your own combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/d8798ca25e185e99e9f95f626c5f9675.poster.avif?t=1788235255\" width=774 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/d8798ca25e185e99e9f95f626c5f9675.webm?t=1788235255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/d8798ca25e185e99e9f95f626c5f9675.mp4?t=1788235255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join the journey to protect the dimensions now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A grand adventure of friendship, survival, and the cat girls’ battle to protect the world begins now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>“Defeat the demons with the power of cat magic!”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/7e71878eb3c538e54923e45409850c6c.avif?t=1788235255\" width=1217 height=811 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Story</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In this magical world, a chosen few cats are born with magical powers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">These cats resemble humans and grow up to become heroes who protect humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">One day, as a crimson moon rises, the boundaries between parallel universes collapse, and demons begin crossing dimensions to launch their attack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dark Ego, a being who turns humanity’s primal desires into demons and plots the end of the world, seeks to corrupt the peaceful world shared by humans and cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But behind Dark Ego lurks yet another entity controlling the demons…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This game is an action fantasy title set in the same universe as its predecessor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The story takes place after the defeat of Dark Ego, the final boss of the previous game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/b2132dd438cdd493d79e99a4817f56af.avif?t=1788235255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras_big/b2132dd438cdd493d79e99a4817f56af.webp?t=1788235255 width=1560 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The cats who once lived in the magical world have now crossed over into modern civilization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Travel across dimensions and explore cities around the world that have been consumed by darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Journey through distinctive locations around the globe, including downtown Tokyo, Times Square in New York, the Alps, Mexico, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/33bdde5b2c2b9f3e846ded52d85ecba2.avif?t=1788235255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras_big/33bdde5b2c2b9f3e846ded52d85ecba2.webp?t=1788235255 width=1560 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/68670452face42415e5992a4c406f9c7.poster.avif?t=1788235255\" width=846 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/68670452face42415e5992a4c406f9c7.webm?t=1788235255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/68670452face42415e5992a4c406f9c7.mp4?t=1788235255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/e703af4fa42482e40c10685bcdc86aef.avif?t=1788235255\" width=1554 height=677 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each character has her own unique combat style and magical skills, bringing a fresh experience to every battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Akane: A fiery cat who fights with her fists, combining powerful strikes with lightning-fast combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Koro: A cool-headed cat who freezes enemies with ice magic and crushes them with her sharp, spear-like staff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Leah: A laid-back cat who unleashes wide-ranging attacks and follows them up with paint projectiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Yuri: A righteous cat who swings a hefty staff and strikes her enemies with electricity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/d61e722f6100c38d218434129bfb2111.avif?t=1788235255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras_big/d61e722f6100c38d218434129bfb2111.webp?t=1788235255 width=1560 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> <u>The moment a magic staff becomes a blunt weapon.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Don’t underestimate a magic staff!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Haven’t you ever wanted to just beat an enemy down with one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience the perfect combination of hard-hitting melee combos and spectacular magical effects, delivering satisfying action for both your eyes and your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Counter System : Feel the thrill of deflecting enemy attacks with perfect timing!<br>Exploit the opening, stun your enemies, and unleash a barrage of attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Aerial Combos : Launch enemies into the air and keep the hits coming! <br>Create your own combo chains and leave your enemies completely overwhelmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Coin System : Collect coins dropped by defeated enemies and grow stronger with every run! <br>Just how powerful can a cat become?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/afb6e2b0fd860ca833dafc638728d3da.avif?t=1788235255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras_big/afb6e2b0fd860ca833dafc638728d3da.webp?t=1788235255 width=1560 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/f642c32fa935a68d22621fe9777eb3fd.poster.avif?t=1788235255\" width=846 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/f642c32fa935a68d22621fe9777eb3fd.webm?t=1788235255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/f642c32fa935a68d22621fe9777eb3fd.mp4?t=1788235255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Normal Battles : Sweep through hordes of enemies with the satisfying impact of classic beat ’em up combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Boss Battles : Counters, parries, and combos! Face powerful bosses in intense one-on-one battles and experience the tension of Soulslike-inspired combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/2414ba4676b382997188f7691cd41430.avif?t=1788235255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras_big/2414ba4676b382997188f7691cd41430.webp?t=1788235255 width=1560 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/d784052f472357df3e9de554dad869c5.poster.avif?t=1788235255\" width=846 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/d784052f472357df3e9de554dad869c5.webm?t=1788235255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/d784052f472357df3e9de554dad869c5.mp4?t=1788235255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Playing alone is fun, but protecting the dimensions with a friend is even better!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use the synergy between characters to create devastating combo plays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Have Koro freeze enemies solid, let Akane smash them apart, then follow up with Leah’s paint attacks for a spectacular co-op battle experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/979191f82d4b919caf2c0fb64713afd0.avif?t=1788235255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras_big/979191f82d4b919caf2c0fb64713afd0.webp?t=1788235255 width=1560 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grow stronger as your enemies become increasingly powerful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use coins earned through combos to unlock character stats and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Add new attacks to your arsenal and create your own unique combo chains!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/9db9e0ca170d8baecde2507b561bb44d.avif?t=1788235255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras_big/9db9e0ca170d8baecde2507b561bb44d.webp?t=1788235255 width=1560 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/4781299a0092d4473acccb8c14550500.poster.avif?t=1788235255\" width=846 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/4781299a0092d4473acccb8c14550500.webm?t=1788235255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/4781299a0092d4473acccb8c14550500.mp4?t=1788235255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Upgraded graphics and hard-hitting combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The adorable cat girls are brought to life with even more vibrant and detailed pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience dazzling magical effects and visual sequences unlike anything else, all rendered in a distinctive pixel-art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/bff36234f80e7c64fab30287c6c966c4.avif?t=1788235255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras_big/bff36234f80e7c64fab30287c6c966c4.webp?t=1788235255 width=1560 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Story Mode</strong> : Embark on a journey to find the final boss controlling the demons from behind the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Co-op Mode</strong> : A two-player cooperative mode to enjoy with a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Boss Rush</strong> : A challenging mode featuring intense battles against a series of bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Tutorial</strong> : Learn the counter and combo systems and practice developing your own combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/d8798ca25e185e99e9f95f626c5f9675.poster.avif?t=1788235255\" width=774 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/d8798ca25e185e99e9f95f626c5f9675.webm?t=1788235255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/d8798ca25e185e99e9f95f626c5f9675.mp4?t=1788235255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join the journey to protect the dimensions now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A grand adventure of friendship, survival, and the cat girls’ battle to protect the world begins now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Demon invasion has shattered the dimensions, filling the world with corrupted souls. Cat girls with unique stories unite through friendship to restore balance by purifying souls and facing fierce bosses. An exciting and adorable side-scrolling action adventure!", "supported_languages": "Korean, English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/7f343db92506feae01543a243da1552e30d734f4/header.jpg?t=1788235255", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/c6bd0ba8655708bb58ac5f8ea470a382c48f422a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788235255", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/c6bd0ba8655708bb58ac5f8ea470a382c48f422a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788235255", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 2.00 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 3.00 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong>